---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Streak Hunter · C/2026 S1 (Euclid)"
	: "拖影猎手 · STREAK HUNTER";
const description = isEn
	? "A space telescope designed to map billions of galaxies across 10 billion light-years accidentally caught its first brand-new comet — because a fast-moving icy visitor smeared into a streak across its deep-sky images (ESA / Euclid Consortium 2026)."
	: "一台旨在丈量百亿光年星系与暗物质的巡天望远镜，意外在深空底片里捕获了人类此前未知的全新彗星——C/2026 S1 (Euclid)。长达 560.52 秒曝光下拉出的移动拖影与彗发，揭开了这场意料之外的天文发现。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#030712] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-cyan-200">
			<!-- Ambient Space Glow -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#38bdf8_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:32px_32px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>ESA / EUCLID CONSORTIUM · 2026-10-19</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>☄️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">欧几里得深空北场 · 首颗新彗星 C/2026 S1</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DEEP FIELD NORTH · FIRST NEW COMET C/2026 S1</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">赫尔辛基大学 × 欧几里得联盟 · 2026-10-19</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Univ. of Helsinki × Euclid · 2026-10-19</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/streak-hunter/" : "/en/projects/streak-hunter/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-cyan-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "切换为中文" : "Switch to English"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">拖影猎手 · STREAK HUNTER</span>
					<span class="lang-en">STREAK HUNTER · C/2026 S1 (Euclid)</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">一台旨在丈量百亿光年星系的巡天望远镜，意外捕获了它的第一颗全新彗星——只因为它在底片上拉出了一道拖影。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">A telescope built to photograph billions of distant galaxies accidentally caught a comet — because it left a streak.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							2026 年 10 月 19 日，欧洲航天局（ESA）与欧几里得科学合作联盟（Euclid Consortium）宣布了一项富有戏剧色彩的天文发现：专为测绘百亿光年遥远星系、探索暗能量与暗物质而设计的<strong>欧几里得空间望远镜（Euclid）</strong>，在深空底片中独立发现了其运行以来的<strong>第一颗此前从未被人类记录过的全新彗星</strong>——已被国际天文学联合会小行星中心（MPC）正式赋予永久编号 <strong>C/2026 S1 (Euclid)</strong>。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							On October 19, 2026, the European Space Agency (ESA) and the Euclid Consortium announced a delightfully serendipitous milestone: the <strong>Euclid space telescope</strong>, designed to map shapes and motions of billions of distant galaxies across 10 billion light-years to decode dark matter and dark energy, discovered its very first previously unknown comet: officially catalogued by the Minor Planet Center (MPC) as <strong>C/2026 S1 (Euclid)</strong>.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							欧几里得绝非为了追踪太阳系天体而造，并且刻意避开了小行星密集的黄道面。然而在 2026 年 9 月 16 日至 24 日深空北场巡天期间，由赫尔辛基大学在读博士生<strong>米科·彭蒂宁（Mikko Pöntinen）</strong>自主编写的移动天体探测算法，在一张长达 <strong>560.52 秒</strong>的可见光（VIS）曝光中敏锐捕捉到了一条被拉长的虚影——不仅是一条直线光痕，其外围更包裹着冰雪升华形成的朦胧<strong>彗发（coma）</strong>。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Euclid was not built to track Solar System rocks, intentionally avoiding the dust-rich ecliptic plane. Yet between September 16 and 24, 2026 during the Euclid Deep Field North survey, automated detection software developed by University of Helsinki PhD student <strong>Mikko Pöntinen</strong> flagged an anomalous "streak" smeared across a <strong>560.52-second</strong> VIS exposure — accompanied by a telltale fuzzy halo of outgassing dust and gas: the <strong>coma</strong>.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Attributed Quotes Section (Exactly the two permitted quotes) -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6">
					<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-cyan-500/30 relative overflow-hidden">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
							<span>💬</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">软件开发者与发现者 · MIKKO PÖNTINEN (赫尔辛基大学)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">SOFTWARE DEVELOPER · MIKKO PÖNTINEN (UNIV. OF HELSINKI)</span>
						</div>
						<blockquote class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 italic font-serif leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								米科·彭蒂宁回忆道：“<strong class="text-cyan-300">I was excited to see my software flag a 'streak' smeared across several images – the result of a fast-moving object.</strong>”
								<span class="block text-xs font-sans text-slate-400 not-italic mt-1">（“看到我的软件在多幅图像中标记出一条拖影时，我感到无比兴奋——这是快速移动天体留下的直接痕迹。”）</span>
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Mikko Pöntinen recalled: "<strong class="text-cyan-300">I was excited to see my software flag a 'streak' smeared across several images – the result of a fast-moving object.</strong>"
							</span>
						</blockquote>
					</div>

					<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-indigo-500/30 relative overflow-hidden">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
							<span>💬</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">欧几里得档案科学家 · BRUNO ALTIERI (ESA)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">EUCLID ARCHIVE SCIENTIST · BRUNO ALTIERI (ESA)</span>
						</div>
						<blockquote class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 italic font-serif leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								布鲁诺·阿尔蒂埃里指出：“<strong class="text-indigo-300">Very few comets are expected to be discovered by Euclid so it was a happy coincidence that the combination of the comet's orbit and Euclid's scanning over those days captured the object in multiple images.</strong>”
								<span class="block text-xs font-sans text-slate-400 not-italic mt-1">（“欧几里得望远镜预计发现的彗星极度稀少，因此这完全是一次美妙的巧合：彗星独特的运行轨道与欧几里得在那些日子里的扫描路径完美交汇，使我们在多幅图像中记录下了它。”）</span>
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Bruno Altieri noted: "<strong class="text-indigo-300">Very few comets are expected to be discovered by Euclid so it was a happy coincidence that the combination of the comet's orbit and Euclid's scanning over those days captured the object in multiple images.</strong>"
							</span>
						</blockquote>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Scientific Honesty Note Card -->
				<div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
					<div class="text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
						<span>🔬</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">科学严谨性与示意图解特别声明</span>
						<span class="lang-en">SCIENTIFIC HONESTY & SCHEMATIC ILLUSTRATION NOTE</span>
					</div>
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							必须明确强调：本页面呈现的所有星空底片、星点分布、移动拖影、闪烁对比器与轨道模型均为用于互动演示与教学解析的<strong>示意性图解（schematic illustrations）</strong>，绝非欧几里得望远镜的真实科学原始图像。C/2026 S1 (Euclid) 处于远在各大行星轨道平面之外的高倾角轨道，<strong>绝不朝向地球移动，对地球没有任何威胁</strong>。本页面绝不虚构其彗核尺寸、彗尾长度或精确轨道周期（已知周期长达数千年，精确数值有待未来观测累积后修正）；提及的“约 13 亿公里”严格代表其在被发现时的瞬时日地距离，而非恒定属性。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							All simulated star fields, streaks, comparator animations, and orbit models on this page are <strong>schematic illustrations</strong> built for conceptual explanation — they are NOT Euclid's real raw images. Comet C/2026 S1 (Euclid) is on an orbit arching far above the planetary disc and <strong>is NOT heading toward Earth and poses zero threat</strong>. We do not invent an orbital period, nucleus size, or tail length (its period is known only to span thousands of years, to be refined with future data). The ~1.3 billion km figure reflects its distance at discovery, not a fixed constant.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- 6. FACTS STRIP SECTION -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
					<span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
						<span class="lang-zh">核心物理事实一览 · FACTS STRIP</span>
						<span class="lang-en">CORE ASTROPHYSICAL FACTS STRIP</span>
					</span>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">永久国际编号</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DESIGNATION</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white mt-1">C/2026 S1</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">欧几里得独立首发</span>
							<span class="lang-en">First Euclid comet</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">巡天发现窗口</span>
							<span class="lang-en">SURVEY WINDOW</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-indigo-300 mt-1">09.16–09.24</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">2026 年深空北场</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Deep Field North 2026</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">视场与曝光次数</span>
							<span class="lang-en">FIELDS & EXPOSURES</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-emerald-300 mt-1">5 视场 · 16 次</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">每视场 2–4 次连续曝光</span>
							<span class="lang-en">5 fields · 16 exposures</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-amber-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">关键定性曝光</span>
							<span class="lang-en">SMOKING GUN EXP.</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-amber-300 mt-1">560.52 s</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">9 月 20 日 VIS 可见光</span>
							<span class="lang-en">20 Sept 2026 VIS</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-sky-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">发现时日地距离</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DISTANCE AT DISCOVERY</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-sky-300 mt-1">~1.3B km</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">约木星与土星轨道间</span>
							<span class="lang-en">~1.3 billion km from Earth</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-purple-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">MPC 确认与公转</span>
							<span class="lang-en">MPC & ORBIT</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-purple-300 mt-1">2026-10-08</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">轨道周期：数千年</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Orbit: thousands of years</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 1. CENTERPIECE: STREAK HUNTER GAME -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-14">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/30 font-mono text-xs mb-1">
							<span>🎮</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">核心互动实验室 · 拖影猎手挑战</span>
							<span class="lang-en">CENTERPIECE GAME · STREAK HUNTER CHALLENGE</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">在欧几里得深空底片里，揪出那颗暗弱的移动彗星</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Hunt the Faint Moving Comet in Euclid's Deep Field</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
						<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300">
							<span class="lang-zh">视场进度：</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Progress: </span>
							<strong id="game-round-badge" class="text-cyan-400">1 / 5</strong>
						</span>
						<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300">
							<span class="lang-zh">得分：</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Score: </span>
							<strong id="game-score-badge" class="text-amber-400">0</strong>
						</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						模拟欧几里得望远镜单次 560.52 秒曝光拍摄的高敏度星野：背景中布满了数百颗恒星与遥远星系。其中<strong>仅潜藏着唯一一道</strong>极细、极淡且边缘带有微弱彗发弥散的斜向移动拖影！请在画面上点击你认为彗星所在的位置。测试你的肉眼辨识力是否能媲美米科·彭蒂宁的探测算法！
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						Simulating a 560.52s Euclid VIS field: the sky is strewn with static stars and fuzzy distant galaxies. Hidden among them is <strong>exactly ONE</strong> faint, thin diagonal streak with a subtle glowing coma. Click on the canvas where you think the comet is! Can your human vision match Mikko Pöntinen's automated pipeline?
					</span>
				</p>

				<!-- Game Canvas Container -->
				<div class="p-3 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="relative w-full aspect-[16/10] sm:aspect-[16/9] max-h-[520px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-[#02040a] cursor-crosshair border border-slate-900">
						<canvas id="canvas-game" class="w-full h-full block"></canvas>

						<!-- Overlay Feedback Banner -->
						<div id="game-feedback-banner" class="absolute top-3 left-3 right-3 sm:left-4 sm:right-auto pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 translate-y-[-8px]">
							<div class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-md text-xs font-mono border shadow-lg inline-flex items-center gap-2" id="game-feedback-pill">
								<span id="game-feedback-icon">🎯</span>
								<span id="game-feedback-text">Candidate Detected</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Software Scan Crosshairs Guide HUD -->
						<div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 pointer-events-none text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-400/80 bg-slate-950/80 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-cyan-900/50 backdrop-blur-xs">
							<span>EUCLID-VIS-SIM // DFN-FIELD-<span id="hud-field-id">01</span> // 560.52s // FOV 0.53 deg²</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Final Verdict Modal (Hidden initially) -->
						<div id="game-verdict-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center p-4 z-20 hidden">
							<div class="max-w-md w-full p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/40 text-center shadow-2xl">
								<div class="text-4xl mb-2">🔭</div>
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">
									<span class="lang-zh">5 组深空视场巡查完毕！</span>
									<span class="lang-en">5 Deep Fields Survey Complete!</span>
								</h3>
								<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 mb-4" id="verdict-rank-title">
									[ RANK: SENIOR COMET HUNTER ]
								</div>
								<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono mb-4">
									<div>
										<div class="text-slate-400 text-[10px]"><span class="lang-zh">命中率</span><span class="lang-en">HITS</span></div>
										<div class="text-base font-bold text-white mt-0.5" id="verdict-hits">5 / 5</div>
