			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10 max-w-4xl space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
						<span class="lang-zh">一、宏伟使命的意外侧影：欧几里得望远镜的星系测绘蓝图</span>
						<span class="lang-en">1. The Serendipitous Side of a Grand Mission: Euclid's Galaxy Atlas</span>
					</h3>
					<p class="mb-3">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							欧几里得（Euclid）是欧洲航天局（ESA）主导的旗舰中型宇宙学空间任务。自 2023 年发射至日地第二拉格朗日点（L2）以来，它的核心科学目标只有一个：在长达六年的任务期内，测量横跨 100 亿光年时空范围内的数十亿个遥远星系的精细三维形态与红移退行速度，绘制有史以来最广袤的宇宙 3D 地图，揭开暗物质与驱动宇宙加速膨胀的暗能量之谜。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Euclid is the European Space Agency's flagship cosmology observatory. Stationed at Sun-Earth Lagrange point 2 (L2), its singular mission over six years is to measure the shapes and motions of billions of galaxies across 10 billion light-years to decode dark matter and dark energy.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							为了实现对百亿光年遥弱星系极其微弱的弱引力透镜形变（weak gravitational lensing）的测量，欧几里得的视场规划极度严苛。然而，正是在其超高灵敏度的可见光相机（VIS）底片中，来自我们太阳系近邻的古老冰块悄然闯入，拉出了一条划破深邃宇宙的亮丽拖影。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							To detect subtle weak gravitational lensing across cosmological epochs, Euclid's optical performance is extraordinarily refined. Yet into these very detectors, an ancient icy relic from our own Solar System backyard drifted, etching an unmistakable streak across the deep cosmos.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
						<span class="lang-zh">二、为什么这次发现极其困难与罕见？</span>
						<span class="lang-en">2. Why Catching This Comet Was Exceptionally Hard</span>
					</h3>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm">
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
							<div class="text-amber-400 font-bold font-mono mb-1.5">01 · 黄道面规避策略</div>
							<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								<span class="lang-zh">大部分彗星与小行星聚集于太阳系各大行星绕行的黄道面。然而黄道面内弥散着高密度的行星际尘埃，会散射太阳光形成“黄道光”眩光。为了追求最纯净的深空星系对比度，欧几里得在轨道设计上刻意回避黄道面。</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Most Solar System bodies hug the ecliptic plane, where dense dust causes blinding zodiacal glare. To preserve extragalactic contrast, Euclid deliberately steers away from the ecliptic.</span>
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
							<div class="text-cyan-400 font-bold font-mono mb-1.5">02 · 步进凝视无法复测</div>
							<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								<span class="lang-zh">欧几里得采用“步进式凝视”（step-and-stare）模式，通常每块天区仅凝视一次即快速转向下一天区，绝不轻易回头。彗星能够恰好连续落在 9 月 16 至 24 日深空北场相互重叠的视场中，属于万载难逢的几何巧合。</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Euclid uses a "step-and-stare" scanning strategy, typically imaging each sky patch once without revisits. The comet passing through overlapping Deep Field North footprints was pure observational luck.</span>
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800">
							<div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold font-mono mb-1.5">03 · 剔除噪声反哺宇宙学</div>
							<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
								<span class="lang-zh">追踪这些太阳系小天体绝非不务正业：移动天体拉出的拖影和额外光晕若不加标识，会被误判为变形星系或透镜效应。彭蒂宁的算法自动识别并剔除这些拖影，直接保障了主任务弱透镜测量的纯净度！</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Detecting moving objects is vital for cosmology: unidentified trails contaminate galaxy shape catalogs. Pöntinen's pipeline cleans transient optical noise directly from precision maps.</span>
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
						<span class="lang-zh">三、未来的演练：与彗星截击机（Comet Interceptor）的协同契机</span>
						<span class="lang-en">3. A Rehearsal for ESA's Comet Interceptor</span>
					</h3>
					<p class="mb-3">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							欧洲航天局正在研制一项突破性的行星探测任务——<strong>彗星截击机（Comet Interceptor）</strong>。以往的彗星飞越探测任务（如罗塞塔号、乔托号）访问的都是已经在太阳系内部绕转无数圈、表面已被太阳烤熟的“熟客彗星”。彗星截击机将先期部署在第二拉格朗日点（L2）静止待命，一旦全球巡天望远镜在木星轨道以外发现一颗从未受热过的、真正从奥尔特云初次跌入的“处女彗星”（dynamically new comet），截击机将紧急点火出击飞掠！
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							ESA is developing a groundbreaking mission: <strong>Comet Interceptor</strong>. Past missions visited short-period comets baked by billions of years near the Sun. Comet Interceptor will loiter at L2 in dormant parking orbit, awaiting alert of a dynamically new, pristine comet entering from the deep Oort Cloud.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							虽然 C/2026 S1 (Euclid) 因极陡倾角与过远距离并不是截击机适合的拦截对象，但从欧几里得底片快速提取、算法报警到 MPC 全球公报确认的完整链条，为欧几里得巡天团队与未来彗星截击机地面指挥中心的预警协同，提供了绝无仅有的实战检验！
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
